1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,108
The Little Prince and Qiqi kept flying, still on their way home.

2
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:09,000
This time they came to a very very small planet.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,691
So small that there was only one lamp post and one person.

4
00:00:13,691 --> 00:00:16,941
That person held a match in their hand.

5
00:00:16,941 --> 00:00:18,647
Snap!

6
00:00:18,647 --> 00:00:20,764
The lamp lit up.

7
00:00:20,764 --> 00:00:22,470
Snap!

8
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:24,735
The lamp went out.

9
00:00:24,735 --> 00:00:27,029
Then it lit up again.

10
00:00:27,029 --> 00:00:29,264
And went out again.

11
00:00:29,264 --> 00:00:31,338
What are you doing?

12
00:00:31,338 --> 00:00:34,205
Qiqi asked curiously.

13
00:00:34,205 --> 00:00:36,514
I'm lighting the lamp.

14
00:00:36,514 --> 00:00:38,779
The person said.

15
00:00:38,779 --> 00:00:41,264
Why do you keep doing it?

16
00:00:41,264 --> 00:00:43,691
Because that's the rule.

17
00:00:43,691 --> 00:00:47,676
Light the lamp in the morning, put it out at night.

18
00:00:47,676 --> 00:00:50,147
But what time is it now?

19
00:00:50,147 --> 00:00:52,455
The person looked up.

20
00:00:52,455 --> 00:00:56,911
This planet was so small, it spun so fast.

21
00:00:56,911 --> 00:01:01,279
It just got bright, and immediately went dark again.

22
00:01:01,279 --> 00:01:02,882
Sigh...

23
00:01:02,882 --> 00:01:06,897
I just lit it, now I have to put it out again.

24
00:01:06,897 --> 00:01:09,544
The person wiped sweat.

25
00:01:09,544 --> 00:01:12,455
Then why don't you rest for a while?

26
00:01:12,455 --> 00:01:14,264
I can't.

27
00:01:14,264 --> 00:01:16,647
The rule is the rule.

28
00:01:16,647 --> 00:01:19,279
Qiqi thought for a moment.

29
00:01:19,279 --> 00:01:22,073
But you've been doing the right thing!

30
00:01:22,073 --> 00:01:26,088
Without you, this planet wouldn't have any light.

31
00:01:26,088 --> 00:01:29,985
The person stopped and looked at the lamp in their hand.

32
00:01:29,985 --> 00:01:33,426
The lamp went out, they lit it again.

33
00:01:33,426 --> 00:01:41,617
The Little Prince said softly: Persisting in doing the right thing, even when it's tiring, is really remarkable.

34
00:01:41,617 --> 00:01:43,647
Qiqi nodded.

35
00:01:43,647 --> 00:01:47,205
I'll do one right thing every day from now on!

36
00:01:47,205 --> 00:01:50,249
The person kept lighting the lamp.

37
00:01:50,249 --> 00:01:51,955
Snap!

38
00:01:51,955 --> 00:01:53,882
It's bright.

39
00:01:53,882 --> 00:01:55,588
Snap!

40
00:01:55,588 --> 00:01:57,470
It's dark.

41
00:01:57,470 --> 00:02:02,176
But this tiny planet became so warm because of that lamp.

42
00:02:02,176 --> 00:02:05,632
Kids, what right thing did you do today?

43
00:02:05,632 --> 00:02:08,441
Tell Qiqi in the comments

